 s locals pricing to Escambia and Santa Rosa county residents and asks for
  a local ID at the counter. The business rebranded from Laguna's Beach Ba
 r and Grill to Laguna's Adventure Park\, which is why the old web address
  no longer works and why some listing sites still show the old restaurant
  as closed.\nPrice: not published by the venue\, so confirm before you go
 \nArea: Pensacola Beach & Perdido\nTimes: Sunday 8/30 · 10:00 AM to 8:00
